{"id": "DfM7_ihx2ZZ", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Ye kandhe jhuk rahe hain, ummeedon ka bhaar zyaada hai… par har toota taara wapas aasmaan dhoondh hi leta hai ✨\n\nNeele kaagaz pe sone ke taare: har ummeed ek taara thi, aur ek ek karke sab bujh kar raakh ban gaye.\nPinjre ka darwaaza khula par parinda aasmaan se dar gaya, dil ki parten taraashi par andar sirf patthar nikla, aur har daanv haara.\nPhir ummeedon ki potli ne kandhe jhuka diye… gaanth khuli, aur saare taare ghoomte hue wapas apne aasmaan mein jaa baithe.\n\n🎵 Taare · Farak @farakmaybe \n\nUsko bhejo jo sabki ummeedon ka bojh akele utha raha hai, aur phir bhi chal raha hai\n\nTaare | Taare Farak | Farak new song | Hindi rap lyrics | sad Hindi song | emotional rap song | ummeedon ka bhaar | cyanotype art | sun print animation | gold leaf stars | lyrics\n\n#Taare #farak #hustle5 claude animation viral", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793543080, "like_count": 483, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1418060600309711a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 73.566, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPMi1OgZ0idzxi-TZsQ7mZ02t8KDvL10o8O6-kBRVsDCnzs3fkj6H-EKt6TD4mDwiNBEWopAbxNFZq0ZY3sPVfJr2TJg6Frew07LQI.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdpnAKQwGCcw1FhxuEbZQYzrqycIo7Tad22A73HzA74e7iTpIDbINiMkAjgt5Xv2aAHIqK8WDB1XPSNiCcESE3aq&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=pKC8Wzyqe9gQ7kNvwHOcgvw&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ZHQGzbuScn-3uF5PLwGN9A&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketles